# Root scratch and planning docs stay workspace-local; the reviewed design docs
# and the project docs remain tracked.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/*-DESIGN.md
# Mid-markup scrape of one preprint section (Yang-Mills, arXiv HTML section 8):
# no tracked file references it and no comparable extract was ever committed, so
# it stays a workspace-local scratch file rather than tree content.
/preprint-section8-lines.txt

# Stray build outputs left at the workspace root.
/build_log.txt
/ResidentVulkanCommit
/tmp/

